        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "EXCELLENT INVESTMENT OPPORTUNITY – CASH BUYERS ONLY\r\nPremium Collection LWK is delighted to introduce Apartment 126, Parkgate Place to the market.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-positioned one-bedroom apartment in one of Dublin’s most strategically located residential areas, immediately adjacent to the Phoenix Park and within easy reach of Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nFor investors, the property offers a particularly attractive combination of location, accessibility and rental appeal, with excellent public transport connections and a designated parking space — features that are highly sought after by tenants in the city.\r\n\r\nA LOCATION THAT WILL ALWAYS ATTRACT TENANTS\r\nParkgate Place enjoys an enviable position just moments from the Phoenix Park, while Dublin City Centre, Heuston Station and the Luas are all within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\n2-minute walk to Phoenix Park\r\n2-minute walk to Luas\r\n4-minute walk to Heuston Station\r\n25-minute walk to O'Connell Street\r\n30-minute walk to Grafton Street\r\nRegular bus services immediately outside the development\r\nThe location provides outstanding connectivity for  working throughout Dublin, while the proximity to the Phoenix Park, city centre, cafés, restaurants, pubs and local amenities adds to the property's long-term rental appeal.\r\n\r\nSTRONG INVESTMENT FUNDAMENTALS\r\nThe combination of a one-bedroom layout, central location, excellent transport links and designated parking makes Apartment 126 particularly well suited to the rental market.\r\n\r\nOne-bedroom apartments in well-connected city locations can appeal strongly to a broad tenant profile, including young  and those seeking convenient access to Dublin’s major employment, business and transport hubs.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a BER C1, helping to provide an important consideration for prospective tenants in today's rental market.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY DETAILS\r\nBuilt in 2001, the apartment is situated on the first floor and includes:\r\n\r\nSpacious one-bedroom accommodation\r\nFirst-floor position\r\nBER C1\r\nDesignated parking space\r\nManagement fee: €1,600 per annum\r\nModern residential development\r\nExcellent city-centre location\r\nImmediate access to the Phoenix Park and extensive transport links\r\nCASH BUYERS ONLY\r\n\r\nThe property is being offered for sale to cash purchasers only, making it particularly suitable for investors who are in a position to proceed without mortgage finance.\r\n\r\nWith its exceptional location, strong rental appeal, excellent transport connectivity and valuable designated parking space, Apartment 126 represents an attractive addition to an investment portfolio or an excellent opportunity for a buyer seeking a city-centre property with long-term rental potential.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.--\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
